    },
    "seo": { "type": "db-rich-content", "settings": { "content": "<p><strong>Daily Delight, Guaranteed.</strong></p><p>Flowers Across Christchurch is about finding beauty in the daily. We pride ourselves on delivering delight through thoughtful flowers, gifts and personal service. If something is not quite right, our friendly local team is here to help.</p><p><strong>Christchurch Flower Delivery</strong></p><p>Our bouquets are handmade by local florists and delivered fresh and with care. Each arrangement is prepared for its occasion using beautiful seasonal flowers and thoughtful presentation.</p><p>Ordering flowers online should feel easy. Choose the bouquet that suits the moment, add the delivery information and your personal message, and our team will take care of the details.</p><p>Our flower and gift range is designed for birthdays, celebrations, thank-yous and the everyday moments that deserve something lovely.</p><p><strong>Same Day Gifting For All Occasions &amp; Events</strong></p><p>When same-day delivery is available, finding and ordering a thoughtful gift is simple and fast. Browse flowers and gifts, select the right arrangement and confirm the recipient details during checkout.</p><p>Alongside fresh bouquets, you can choose thoughtful extras and gifts to make the delivery feel personal. Product and delivery availability is shown while you shop.</p>", "background": "#fffaf3", "text_color": "#41511d", "content_width": "custom", "custom_width": 960, "padding_top": 36, "padding_bottom": 72 } }
